  "description": "Introducing Bubble Groovie, the epitome of modern retro font design. It’s bold and crisp with a unique decorative twist – a dual-style font presenting you both clean and decorative variations. Packed with a full range of upper and lower case letters, numbers, punctuation, and multi-lingual support, it’s versatile and ready to be injected into any project. Perfectly suited for logos, stickers, packaging designs, Cricut Projects, headlines, or brand identities, it doesn’t stop just there. Whether you’re crafting for t-shirts, creating a captivating magazine, writing a book, designing for YouTube, Instagram, websites or any innovative design projects – \nBubble Groovie is the key to adding a modern, bubbly vibe to your designs. Harness the power of this Daily Bubble font to turn any design concept into an eye-catching reality!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Introducing Bubble Groovie, the epitome of modern retro font design. It’s bold and crisp with a unique decorative twist – a dual-style font presenting you both clean and decorative variations. Packed with a full range of upper and lower case letters, numbers, punctuation, and multi-lingual support, it’s versatile and ready to be injected into any project. Perfectly suited for logos, stickers, packaging designs, Cricut Projects, headlines, or brand identities, it doesn’t stop just there. Whether you’re crafting for t-shirts, creating a captivating magazine, writing a book, designing for YouTube, Instagram, websites or any innovative design projects – </p>\n<p>Bubble Groovie is the key to adding a modern, bubbly vibe to your designs. Harness the power of this Daily Bubble font to turn any design concept into an eye-catching reality!</p>",
